# Reins of the Pack Kodo from Huey Sunnydale at the Azeroth Commerce Authority
# camp.
# The reins cost 6,000 Merchant's Favor, earned from crate hand-ins at the camps.
# Sources: NPC 256736 (position); Forever
# client 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools (ItemSparse 262766: level 60, Journeyman
# Riding). Merchant's Favor is a currency Polestar cannot count.

step Azeroth Commerce Authority
  tip The camp is at Three Corners in western Redridge Mountains, between Elwynn Forest and Lakeshire. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them, and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the Pack Kodo costs 6,000. Craftsman's Writs may help from level 10.
  goto 10.5,72.7 "Azeroth Commerce Authority camp" live

step Pack Kodo
  tip The reins need level 60 and Journeyman Riding to ride (Forever client); you can buy them earlier. By beta reports Huey Sunnydale sells them only once you are Exalted with the Azeroth Commerce Authority: crates pay only Favor, so follow the Supply Factions Reputation guide (Craftsman's Writs and the Shipping Label pay the reputation).
  vendor 256736 "Huey Sunnydale" @8.5,72.1 live
  buy 262766 "Reins of the Pack Kodo" npc 256736 -- 6,000 Merchant's Favor
